{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15846","headline":"虔州见郑表新诗因以寄赠 · 崔峒","name":"虔州见郑表新诗因以寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梅花岭里见新诗，感激情深过楚词。\n平子四愁今莫比，休文八咏自同时。\n萍乡露冕真堪惜，凤沼鸣珂已讶迟。\n才子风流定难见，湖南春草但相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}